cnc_trackexport - soundtrack export for the C&C Remastered Collection (Linux)

The filenames are exactly the titles the game shows in its own jukebox.  They
are not guessed; they are read out of the game data:

  Data/MUSIC.MEG   the audio (Petroglyph MEG V3)
